{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンダーランドへようこそ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、個別握手会でした。\nなのでそのお話を..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ等については次に..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部目:不思議の国のアリス"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「一緒にお茶会！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部目:ひなデビル(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「がおー！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部:猫耳メイドさん(写真は若干違くって、ハーフツインで猫耳だったの)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「もえもえきゅん！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん♡\nありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完売もでていたらしく、\n嬉しいことにたくさんの方々が\n来てくださっていてありがたい。。。\nたのしかった(>_<)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また待ってます。!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後Pプロデュースの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不思議の国のななみちゃん。☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外すぎてななみのファンは\nびっくりしたでしょ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかくハロウィンだから\n3部限定で無理やりやらせました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛かったからおっけー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもななみのファンは、\nななみもう無理しないでいいよって\n優しかったみたいで(笑)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貴重だったのでみれた人\nラッキーということで♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奈々未ソロカットは、\n奈々未に送ったので\nもしかしたら奈々未ブログで\nみれるかもପ꒰⑅•ᴗ•｡꒱໊੭♡♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーに色んなコスプレして欲しい。このメンバーにこれやってー\nとかあるのかな？( ੭•͈ω•͈)੭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後へのコスプレ希望も受け付けるし、\n他の推しにあれ貸してあげてーとかも教えてー꒰⑅•ᴗ•｡꒱໊♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Amiversary"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TeamDでお手紙読んだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな仮装してるから異様な光景...笑\nあみのメイドさんで\nハタチ迎えるのも中々だけど、\nちーちゃんのサリーも笑った！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームDのゆかいさ(笑)\nずっとチームDは友達です。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ本当におめでとう。\nバカやってるあみがすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふかわご♡Love"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サターンこんなに似合う人いない！！\nほんと可愛い！！！！神がかってる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ฅ( •ω• ฅ)ｶﾞｵ-♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トリックorトリート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いたずらしちゃうぞー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/10/20/1705513/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴょん"}],"source":"archive"}